# SHA-256 of the Tor and lyrebird executables the app packages, one line per
# ABI and library: <abi>/<library> <sha256>. The build verifies the Tor
# executables built by packaging/tor-android (Tor 0.4.9.14, see its
# PROVENANCE.md) and the lyrebird executables built by
# packaging/lyrebird-android (lyrebird 0.9.0, see its PROVENANCE.md) against
# these values before they are packaged, and the app verifies the file it is
# about to execute against them before every Tor start. Only the ABIs listed
# here are packaged.
arm64-v8a/libtor.so 8598ddd59a99bc78053441ecaf09a91b51f4038f5e2dd375428ea05d61030a93
armeabi-v7a/libtor.so f6068c70a7646847c3b5f92bc79bd0fc258b7cb6ecf07567f34344d00b033724
arm64-v8a/liblyrebird.so 9a89df982f1137b120fae152d46ab400558cef7d633987d5518c4ff24a088869
armeabi-v7a/liblyrebird.so 1e521cb83a15fcbbe26a06683b3212d1a924d45c316dde46f0e0a9b25dd5e135
